== Trivia ==
*Unhinged Kloon is a reference to {{RN|mvp+|Minikloon}}, a former {{RN|Admin}}. Their skin is a black version of Minikloon's skin.
*Unhinged Kloon's dialogue references conspiracy theories about [[w:Chemtrail conspiracy theory|chemtrails]], [[w:Moon landing conspiracy theories|the Moon landings]], [[w:Flat Earth conspiracy theory|the shape of the Earth]], and [[w:Big Brother (Nineteen Eighty-Four)#Use as metaphor|Big Brother]].

